    rdf:value """Sunday, September 3, 1916, Vallombrosa
B.B. and Naima came up to lunch and we had a long walk. It is too beautiful. Met the Buttles and Andersens.
Geoffrey had a further talk with Yoï, which he said was too horrible for words. She threatened to make it impossible for him to live in Italy. She said he had never met such malignity and baseness. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 212 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1916> .

